= Gustav Noske

Gustav Noske, ‘the bloodhound’, is [? if chancellor = "Noske": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Noske": the current President and ?] a controversial character to say the least, particularly for his work putting down left-wing insurrections and his muted response to the Kapp Pustch. Many elements of our party were rather he was expelled, but he remains, for now, at our service.

- @military_affairs
- @iron_front_buildup
- @form_iron_front
- @chancellor
- @president

@military_affairs
title: Military affairs
subtitle: We can set our military policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government and reichswehr_minister_party == "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not in government. ?][? if reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD": The SPD does not have the Reichswehr ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: military_policy

@iron_front_buildup
title: Build up the Iron Front
subtitle: Increase our propaganda measures to recruit more members into the Reichsbanner. 
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if iron_front_formed == 0 : The Iron Front has not yet been formed. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rb_strength += 200*workers_spd/(workers_spd+workers_kpd+workers_nsdap+workers_z+workers_dnvp+workers_other);

We have recruited more members into the Reichsbanner.


@form_iron_front
title: Forming the Iron Front
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0 and nazi_urgency >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if iron_front_formed : The Iron Front has already been formed. ?][? if nazi_urgency < 2 : The party does not yet see the danger of the Nazis. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rb_strength += 50; nazi_urgency += 1
go-to: confronting_nazis.iron_front

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
